{
	"desc": "Shaping items (scripts/core/garden_items.gd; design briefs/design/GARDEN_MODERN.md section 1). They live in the garden bag (Save.d items), are fed from a Boki's feed menu, and always show their exact effect (no 'Effect: ?' rule). Effects: stat = +n to one Care.STATS stat up to its cap; xp = +n xp (levels and forms follow); token = a worn path token for the aff (rec.path, at most max_tokens, take_off returns it to the bag); stay = worn Stayleaf (rec.stay); rinse = clear rec.lean; loose = up to n points out of the Boki's highest stat into rec.loose. sources are where the item comes from; this file does not drop them. Nest items (scripts/core/nest_items.gd) are placed in the Nesting Nook with a pair and used up when the egg is laid: nest gifts = n more inborn gifts from the parents per Thread (at most max Threads); species = the baby is the species of the parent wearing it; habit = the baby takes that parent's habit and strongest trait exactly. down = trust +trust and a memory line (one drops at every hatch).",
	"pip": 6.0,
	"pip_doc": "Affinity points one worn path token adds to its path when a form is chosen (Evo.leading); the same as one meal of that path's food.",
	"max_tokens": 3,
	"max_tokens_doc": "Path tokens worn at once on one Boki.",
	"verbs": {
		"eaten": "ate",
		"worn": "put on"
	},
